<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">02042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Israel's Knesset has enacted a death penalty that applies to one people only.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The law mandates capital punishment exclusively for Palestinians convicted of lethal attacks Israel classifies as terrorism — no pardon, no commutation, no appeal to clemency.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>A military tribunal is now being assembled to prosecute October seventh defendants under the statute, and Amnesty International's called it one of the most extreme death penalty laws in the world.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran's flatly denied Trump's claim that its president requested a ceasefire — a framing battle over who blinked first in a war now entering its second month.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Behind the public denials, US and Iranian officials are quietly discussing terms for reopening the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme>, the outcome the war was ostensibly fought to achieve.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The strait remains closed, no mediator's been named, and no timeline's been set.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's Social Development Minister told Parliament that two luxury SUVs from Chinese officials were donations to the ANC Women's League.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>An investigation found both vehicles — manufactured by state-linked automaker <sub alias="B A I C">BAIC</sub> — were registered to the minister's own children.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Tolashe remains in cabinet, and the ANC hasn't indicated whether it'll even open an inquiry.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's declared Luhansk Oblast fully captured — a claim Ukraine's military disputes.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The Third Assault Brigade says it still holds a western border strip Russia hasn't controlled since twenty twenty-two.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Moscow's declaring victory now looks less like a military fact and more like leverage ahead of stalled ceasefire talks.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Violence returned to Jos the moment Plateau State's curfew lifted.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Sunday's attack on Angwan Rukuba killed at least twenty-seven people, and by Wednesday gunshots resumed in Nassarawa Gwom before security forces could arrive.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Jos has cycled through massacres and lockdowns since two thousand and one — twenty-five years in which the curfew has become the only governance the city knows.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington's lifted sanctions on Venezuela's acting president Delcy Rodríguez, weeks after US forces captured Maduro in Caracas on drug trafficking charges.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>With the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme> shut, Venezuelan crude is suddenly strategic — the same resource Washington spent years sanctioning.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Rodríguez's ninety-day mandate expires in June, and whether US goodwill outlasts America's need for her oil is the question Caracas can't yet answer.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Egypt listed ten state-owned companies on its stock exchange to international praise — but sources say the government has no intention of selling shares.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The move clears an IMF obligation on paper while Cairo awaits a one-point-six-five billion dollar payout that requires demonstrated privatization progress.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>In the same week, a third fuel hike in twelve months triggered food inflation, and President Sisi's response was to threaten merchants with military tribunals for raising the prices his own policies caused.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australia imports more than eighty percent of its fuel — a vulnerability the Iran war has now made impossible to ignore.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Prime Minister Albanese announced six hundred ninety-three million dollars in emergency loans for businesses, alongside a thirty-two cent petrol tax cut to cushion the supply shock.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>His May budget will reveal whether a wealthy nation can buy its way out of an energy dependency it chose not to fix.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The World Bank's lending Turkey nearly two billion dollars for a hundred-and-twenty-seven-kilometer rail line connecting Istanbul's Asian and European sides.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The project would carry thirty-three million passengers a year and link both international airports across the Bosphorus.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Additional financing is still needed to break ground on what the bank calls Turkey's largest-ever transport investment.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Artemis Two launched four astronauts toward the Moon yesterday — humanity's first crewed lunar mission in fifty-four years.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Victor Glover becomes the first Black astronaut bound for lunar orbit; by April sixth the crew will be farther from Earth than any human has ever traveled.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The last time people attempted this journey, Richard Nixon was president and the Apollo program was about to be cancelled.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Nature study across China's thirty-one provinces has found that cutting carbon emissions and air pollution together delivers health and economic returns exceeding the cost of action.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The finding demolishes the familiar argument that clean air comes at the economy's expense — province-level data shows decarbonization pays for itself through reduced healthcare costs alone.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Other developing nations now have the evidence; replicating it requires the kind of coordinated policy few governments can impose.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two hundred marble factories are poisoning Mohmand district's waterways in Pakistan's tribal northwest.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Untreated slurry is silting government dams and blocking seasonal streams, raising flash flood risk for farming communities who drink from the same water.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Most factory owners have refused relocation to a designated economic zone — the jobs stay, and so does the poison.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Tokyo have found a drug that reverses schizophrenia symptoms in mice through a mechanism no approved medication has ever used.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Every antipsychotic since nineteen fifty-two targets the same dopamine receptor, causing debilitating movement disorders in most patients; this compound works through an entirely different pathway called <sub alias="row kinase two">Rho-kinase 2</sub>.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>It hasn't been tested in humans yet — but twenty-four million people are living with a disease whose core treatment hasn't changed in seven decades.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Memory chips now cost more than the hobbyist computers they're supposed to power.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Three companies — Samsung, SK Hynix, and Micron — control ninety-five percent of global DRAM production, and AI datacenter demand is consuming the supply that once kept consumer prices low.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The thirty-five dollar single-board computer that democratized programming is being priced out of reach by the AI boom it helped inspire.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>AI-generated disinformation has made war footage impossible to verify — and that's the point.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Researchers call it the liar's dividend: once manufactured doubt exists, real footage becomes as suspect as the fakes, and any evidentiary standard collapses.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>You don't need to fabricate a video if you've trained everyone to distrust all video.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An AI has written a working FreeBSD kernel exploit — not just flagging a vulnerability, but building a deployable remote attack without human guidance.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The exploit targets a published flaw and is now publicly available, meaning every unpatched system is exposed to direct compromise.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The boundary between AI as a defensive security tool and AI as autonomous attack infrastructure has effectively vanished.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>